ob text "\" \"" to name thumbnail select cmd be plus do
ob text of ob of manuscript to name thumbnail select cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name thumbnail select cmd be plus do
ob text of ob of manuscript to name thumbnail select cmd be plus do
